Comment: 0,1:54:06.52,1:54:10.52,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}忘{\k25}卻{\k25}痛{\k25}苦
Comment: 0,1:54:11.02,1:54:16.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}悄{\k25}無{\k25}聲{\k25}息{\k25}靜{\k25}落{\k25}於{\k25}你{\k25}脊{\k25}梁
Comment: 0,1:54:18.32,1:54:22.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}流{\k25}著{\k25}淚{\k25}笑{\k25}了
Comment: 0,1:54:23.39,1:54:29.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}如{\k25}思{\k25}念{\k25}一{\k25}去{\k25}不{\k25}復{\k25}返{\k25}的{\k25}日{\k25}子{\k25}般
Comment: 0,1:54:29.42,1:54:35.39,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}於{\k25}滿{\k25}溢{\k25}著{\k25}奇{\k25}妙{\k25}憐{\k25}愛{\k25}的
Comment: 0,1:54:35.77,1:54:40.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}庭{\k25}園{\k25}盆{\k25}景{\k25}之{\k25}中
Comment: 0,1:54:41.02,1:54:45.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}屏{\k25}息{\k25}凝{\k25}神
Comment: 0,1:54:47.34,1:54:53.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}忘{\k25}卻{\k25}季{\k25}節{\k25}的{\k25}更{\k25}替
Comment: 0,1:54:53.36,1:54:59.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}置{\k25}身{\k25}於{\k25}如{\k25}沉{\k25}靜{\k25}水{\k25}底{\k25}般{\k25}的
Comment: 0,1:54:59.29,1:55:05.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}時{\k25}光{\k25}之{\k25}中
Comment: 0,1:55:06.43,1:55:11.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}冰{\k25}冷{\k25}的{\k25}花{\k25}瓣{\k25} {\k25}寒{\k25}夜{\k25}中{\k25}凋{\k25}謝
Comment: 0,1:55:12.13,1:55:15.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}就{\k25}好{\k25}像{\k25} {\k25}白{\k25}雪{\k25}飄{\k25}揚{\k25}般
Comment: 0,1:55:15.91,1:55:17.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}那{\k25}些{\k25}痛{\k25}苦{\k25}的
Comment: 0,1:55:18.13,1:55:24.16,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}飄{\k25}落{\k25}於{\k25}你{\k25}身{\k25}上{\k25}的{\k25} {\k25}所{\k25}有{\k25}的{\k25}悲{\k25}傷
Comment: 0,1:55:24.50,1:55:29.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}我{\k25}只{\k25}想{\k25}竭{\k25}盡{\k25}所{\k25}能{\k25} {\k25}將{\k25}其{\k25}全{\k25}部{\k25}拂{\k25}去
Comment: 0,1:55:29.98,1:55:35.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}傷{\k25}害{\k25}你{\k25}的{\k25}一{\k25}切{\k25}事{\k25}物
Comment: 0,1:55:36.13,1:55:37.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}我{\k25}絕{\k25}對
Comment: 0,1:55:38.00,1:55:41.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}無{\k25}法{\k25}饒{\k25}恕
Comment: 0,1:55:42.13,1:55:43.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}回{\k25}想{\k25}起{\k25}那{\k25}段{\k25}安{\k25}詳{\k25}的{\k25}日{\k25}子
Comment: 0,1:55:44.01,1:55:48.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}不{\k25}禁{\k25}潸{\k25}然{\k25}淚{\k25}下{\k25} {\k25}好{\k25}想{\k25}回{\k25}去
Comment: 0,1:55:48.58,1:55:52.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}與{\k25}你{\k25}一{\k25}同{\k25} {\k25}仰{\k25}望{\k25}過{\k25}的{\k25}花{\k25}瓣
Comment: 0,1:55:53.02,1:55:57.92,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}早{\k25}已{\k25}玉{\k25}殞{\k25}香{\k25}消
Comment: 0,1:56:06.50,1:56:11.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}月{\k25}亮{\k25}躲{\k25}藏{\k25}在{\k25}雲{\k25}朵{\k25}後{\k25}面
Comment: 0,1:56:12.48,1:56:16.93,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}令{\k25}你{\k25}迷{\k25}失{\k25}道{\k25}路
Comment: 0,1:56:17.18,1:56:23.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}泫{\k25}然{\k25}欲{\k25}泣{\k25}的{\k25}雙{\k25}眼
Comment: 0,1:56:24.49,1:56:30.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}縱{\k25}使{\k25}心{\k25}已{\k25}殘{\k25}如{\k25}鋸{\k25}齒
Comment: 0,1:56:30.53,1:56:34.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}若{\k25}有{\k25}兩{\k25}顆{\k25}吻{\k25}合{\k25}相{\k25}依{\k25}靠
Comment: 0,1:56:35.01,1:56:40.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}一{\k25}定{\k25}能{\k25}孕{\k25}育{\k25}出
Comment: 0,1:56:42.48,1:56:46.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}溫{\k25}柔{\k25}之{\k25}物
Comment: 0,1:56:47.38,1:56:53.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}傷{\k25}害{\k25}我{\k25}的{\k25}事{\k25}物
Comment: 0,1:56:53.37,1:56:59.36,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}你{\k25}答{\k25}應{\k25}我{\k25}絕{\k25}不{\k25}饒{\k25}恕
Comment: 0,1:56:59.75,1:57:06.44,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}僅{\k25}是{\k25}如{\k25}此{\k25}我{\k25}已{\k25}滿{\k25}足
Comment: 0,1:57:30.88,1:57:35.56,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}你{\k25}開{\k25}玩{\k25}笑{\k25}般{\k25}向{\k25}我{\k25}伸{\k25}出{\k25}的{\k25}手
Comment: 0,1:57:35.75,1:57:41.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}我{\k25}將{\k25}其{\k25}緊{\k25}緊{\k25}握{\k25}住
Comment: 0,1:57:42.11,1:57:47.42,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}終{\k25}將{\k25}為{\k25}這{\k25}心{\k25}灰{\k25}意{\k25}冷{\k25}的{\k25}世{\k25}界
Comment: 0,1:57:47.73,1:57:56.54,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}點{\k25}亮{\k25}一{\k25}盞{\k25}溫{\k25}暖{\k25}的{\k25}燈{\k25}火
Comment: 0,1:57:57.48,1:58:02.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}冰{\k25}冷{\k25}的{\k25}花{\k25}瓣{\k25} {\k25}鋒{\k25}芒{\k25}斬{\k25}裂{\k25}長{\k25}夜
Comment: 0,1:58:03.14,1:58:08.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}我{\k25}把{\k25}摘{\k25}下{\k25}的{\k25}光{\k25}芒{\k25} {\k25}全{\k25}部{\k25}捆{\k25}在{\k25}一{\k25}起
Comment: 0,1:58:09.13,1:58:12.42,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}只{\k25}為{\k25}在{\k25}你{\k25}上{\k25}方
Comment: 0,1:58:12.42,1:58:15.28,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}如{\k25}祝{\k25}賀{\k25}般
Comment: 0,1:58:15.50,1:58:20.38,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}為{\k25}你{\k25}揮{\k25}灑{\k25}殆{\k25}盡
Comment: 0,1:58:21.00,1:58:23.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}若{\k25}我{\k25}做{\k25}了{\k25}壞{\k25}事
Comment: 0,1:58:23.77,1:58:27.16,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}你{\k25}一{\k25}定
Comment: 0,1:58:27.16,1:58:33.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}會{\k25}對{\k25}我{\k25}發{\k25}脾{\k25}氣{\k25} {\k25}我{\k25}們{\k25}約{\k25}定{\k25}過{\k25}的{\k25}對{\k25}吧
Comment: 0,1:58:33.52,1:58:36.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}所{\k25}以{\k25}你{\k25}一{\k25}定{\k25}能{\k25} {\k25}再{\k25}一{\k25}次
Comment: 0,1:58:36.50,1:58:40.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}找{\k25}到{\k25}我{\k25}的{\k25}對{\k25}吧
Comment: 0,1:58:40.95,1:58:43.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}寂{\k25}若{\k25}死{\k25}灰{\k25}的{\k25}地{\k25}方
Comment: 0,1:58:44.00,1:58:47.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}我{\k25}已{\k25}不{\k25}必{\k25}蜷{\k25}縮{\k25}於{\k25}此{\k25}了{\k25}吧
Comment: 0,1:58:47.04,1:58:50.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}獨{\k25}自{\k25}一{\k25}人{\k25} {\k25}仰{\k25}望{\k25}過{\k25}的{\k25}花{\k25}瓣
Comment: 0,1:58:50.00,1:58:55.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}早{\k25}已{\k25}玉{\k25}殞{\k25}香{\k25}消
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,----------SCREEN----------
