Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:49.00,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\1c&H745A3A&\shad2\4c&HEFEEEC&\t(1339,1589,\c&HD6C8BA&\shad0)\fade(0,0,50,0,0,1339,1589)\pos(970,730)}嫌犯疑似棄車逃逸
